WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.917
Welcome to Master 11 — Planning Intelligence for EXL Salesforce COE Resource 360.

2
00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:10.469
This recording covers 4 governed stages through actual Salesforce navigation.

3
00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:15.476
The acting personas are COE Staffer · Portfolio Manager · Administrator.

4
00:00:15.476 --> 00:00:22.303
Every stage uses fictional seeded data, visible selection, filtering, evidence lineage and an action outcome.

5
00:00:22.303 --> 00:00:28.675
Salesforce remains the transactional system of record; the public companion is read-only and sanitized.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.854
AIUI-01 is Resource assistant, stage 1 in Planning Intelligence.

7
00:00:33.854 --> 00:00:38.137
Ask evidence-backed questions across authorized staffing, capability and delivery data.

8
00:00:38.137 --> 00:00:47.559
The acting COE Staffer or Portfolio Manager or Administrator works only with records returned inside the effective Salesforce role and portfolio scope.

9
00:00:47.559 --> 00:00:58.695
In this live interaction we use the visible filters, select a specific record or planning state, expose source ownership and server-validation evidence, and prepare “Ask Resource360”.

10
00:00:58.695 --> 00:01:08.117
Human confirmation; evidence links; model/version; protected attributes excluded The screen retains AI_QUERY; RECOMMENDATION_REVIEWED; HUMAN_DECISION so the resulting choice is attributable and reviewable.

11
00:01:08.117 --> 00:01:22.678
The operational surface differs from the preceding stage because it is designed around this decision: its live dataset, visual model, exception state and primary control follow the ai contract rather than a generic call-to-action.

12
00:01:22.678 --> 00:01:35.955
No EXL production identity or integration is invoked; all records are fictional, while the Salesforce metadata, Apex authority, sharing, effective dates and audit behavior are genuine in the Developer Edition demonstration.

